note irequiv fixture (issue 826): reverse the bits of a byte.
note bitrev8 is copied verbatim from tests/one_layer/omegese/dev/dev09.omegese
note (omega-mv 62d1d0d6). bitrev8s is a refactor: a three-stage swap network.
fn bitrev8 x uchar to uchar
r = uchar 0
for i uint 8
r = shl r 1
b = and x 1
r = or r b
x = shr x 1
end
ret r
end
fn bitrev8s x uchar to uchar
x = or shr and x 240 4 shl and x 15 4
x = or shr and x 204 2 shl and x 51 2
ret or shr and x 170 1 shl and x 85 1
end
